OL,3,AFrom Nagaland to a path to the Oscars:
OL,4,AIndian film brings a rarely seen world
OL,5,Ato global cinema
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere is something pleasingly
OL,8,Fimprobable about Angh.
OL,10,FThe film comes from Nagaland, a
OL,11,Fmountainous state of fewer than two
OL,12,Fmillion people on India's northeastern
OL,13,Ffrontier, and is in Konyak, a tribal
OL,14,Flanguage unfamiliar to most Indians,
OL,15,Fnever mind audiences abroad. It was
OL,16,Fdirector Theja Rio's first feature and
OL,17,Fmost of its cast faced a camera for the
OL,18,Ffirst time.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11913
SC,0013
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1790317097
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFrom Nagaland to a path to the Oscars:
OL,4,AIndian film brings a rarely seen world
OL,5,Ato global cinema
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnd yet, at the Toronto International
OL,8,FFilm Festival this month, this quiet
OL,9,Ffilm won the Platform Prize, a major
OL,10,Fjuried award.
OL,12,FThe award is intended to recognise
OL,13,Ffilms with a particularly distinctive
OL,14,Fdirectorial voice. The jury praised
OL,15,FRio's "refreshing perspective" and the
OL,16,Ffilm's portrait of a world rarely
OL,17,Fencountered on the international
OL,18,Fscreen.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
